  "helpRelationsTitle": "Extra relations",
  "helpRelationsBody": "A node has one parent for layout, but it can also have many extra relations. Select a node → Relations, choose another node, then add an optional label and cardinality (for example belongs to, N:1). Relations use curved dashed arrows attached to box edges and do not change the tree layout. A relation that duplicates a parent-child branch is not drawn twice."
